  "details": "Sometimes, some components of the client (local player movement, menu behaviour, gravity and more) slow down or stutter when Vsync is on. Turning off Vsync solves the issue.\n\nThe look of the remote player movement is fine 🤔\n\nHow to reproduce:\n\n1. Open VRChat\n\n2. Enable Vsync from the settings\n\n3. It's fine at first, but it will get worse over time\n\n4. Local player movement and menus are slower",
